1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,456
做 6 分钟的视频，
A six-minute video

2
00:00:01,476 --> 00:00:04,830
Google Veo 3.1 标准版要 144 美元。
on Google's Veo 3.1 Standard costs $144.

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,072
Claude 只用掉悠一 20x 套餐
Claude used just 5–10% of Yui's

4
00:00:07,092 --> 00:00:09,300
一周额度的 5% 到 10%。
weekly 20x plan quota.

5
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,572
9 月 28 日的教程，
Yui's September 28 tutorial uses Opus 5.5,

6
00:00:10,592 --> 00:00:13,530
用的是 9 月 22 日发布的 Opus 5.5。
released on September 22.

7
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,289
Claude 不会生成图片，
Claude can't generate images,

8
00:00:15,309 --> 00:00:16,890
官方文档写得很明白。
and the official docs say so plainly.

9
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:18,751
那视频怎么来？Claude 说：
So where do videos come from?

10
00:00:18,771 --> 00:00:21,090
每个像素，都是它自己画的。
Claude says it draws every pixel itself.

11
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,900
一秒 30 张图，20 秒就是 600 张。
Thirty images a second, so 20 seconds is 600 images.

12
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,400
放进 HTML 页面，
They go into an HTML page,

13
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,420
用 ffmpeg 合成视频。
and ffmpeg stitches them into a video.

14
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,034
画完还会自己截图、
Then it screenshots and samples frames

15
00:00:29,054 --> 00:00:30,330
抽帧检查。
to check its own work.

16
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,716
银魂、火影、JoJo 的像素动画，
The Gintama, Naruto and JoJo pixel animations

17
00:00:32,736 --> 00:00:34,870
都是一段提示词做出来的。
each came from a single prompt.

18
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,205
连角色嘴巴的开合，
Even the character's mouth opening and closing,

19
00:00:36,225 --> 00:00:37,940
它也自己截图确认。
it checked by taking screenshots.

20
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:40,318
角色素材画一次，下次直接用，
Draw the character assets once, reuse them,

21
00:00:40,338 --> 00:00:42,790
还能做成 skill 批量出片。
and turn it all into a skill for batch videos.

22
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:45,314
144 美元，是按每一秒都一次成功
That $144 assumes every second works on the first try;

23
00:00:45,334 --> 00:00:47,340
算的，重来要另外付钱。
retries cost extra.

24
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,912
Veo 3.1 的 Fast 版，
Veo 3.1 Fast is $0.12 a second,

25
00:00:48,932 --> 00:00:52,020
每秒 0.12 美元，6 分钟约 43 美元。
about $43 for six minutes.

26
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,620
但现在画的是像素风，
But for now it draws pixel art;

27
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,560
真人风格得等模型升级。
realistic human styles must wait for better models.

28
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,189
3D 渲染、游戏过场，
Yui says diffusion models fit better

29
00:00:57,209 --> 00:01:00,020
悠一自己也说该交给扩散模型。
for 3D rendering and game cutscenes.

30
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,457
视频模型按秒收费，
Video models charge by the second;

31
00:01:01,477 --> 00:01:03,860
Claude 画一次，反复用。
Claude draws once and reuses it.
